    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Tower is a horror game where you must escape from a 600-meter-high radio tower within 10 minutes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist wakes up to find themselves on a 600-meter-high radio tower. The time limit is 10 minutes. Use your wits to escape the tower!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the items left in the tower and think strategically to make your escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ending</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb3 Normal Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb1 Hidden Ending</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can experience all endings in about 50 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed by a 15-year-old solo developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Posting Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations can post and stream videos without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please adhere to the following guidelines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the game's name in the video title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While optional, we would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in the video description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAYBIS GAMES is not responsible for any damages caused by posting or streaming gameplay videos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Tower is a horror game where you must escape from a 600-meter-high radio tower within 10 minutes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist wakes up to find themselves on a 600-meter-high radio tower. The time limit is 10 minutes. Use your wits to escape the tower!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the items left in the tower and think strategically to make your escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ending</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb3 Normal Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb1 Hidden Ending</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can experience all endings in about 50 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed by a 15-year-old solo developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Posting Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations can post and stream videos without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please adhere to the following guidelines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the game's name in the video title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While optional, we would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in the video description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAYBIS GAMES is not responsible for any damages caused by posting or streaming gameplay videos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You wake up to find yourself on a radio tower 600 meters above the ground. With only 10 minutes to spare, escape the tower!",
